WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.988
This retention query starts from the recent-activity
view A CTE

00:00:06.001 --> 00:00:11.620
finds the last transaction per customer Another CTE
applies

00:00:11.647 --> 00:00:17.229
a sixty-day inactivity threshold That threshold is
intentionally

00:00:17.242 --> 00:00:23.216
report-specific If another report wants ninety days
the shared activity

00:00:23.242 --> 00:00:24.742
view does not need to change
